    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tower rises in the clouds, floating in a distant realm. And you've come a long way, driven by curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A  challenging 2D platformer that will test your skills. Master the pogo technique and climb through the different areas to reach the top of the tower, where its creator awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the strange creatures that inhabit the place. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all the medallions - will they be of any use?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets of the tower. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pogo Witch has been developed by me alone, except for the amazing music by Dan Espinosa (DanTraveler_).  </p>",
